\"“老爷一夜没睡，在园里走来走去，只是叹气。”\", \"a2935347458d\"]]"},{"name":"face","type":"string","value":"down"},{"name":"gives","type":"string","value":"pearls"},{"name":"gives_when","type":"string","value":"node:a2"},{"name":"give","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The old steward unlocks the family chest. “The pearls your father kept, master. Whatever you need them for, I never saw.”\", \"老管家打开家中宝箱。“这是老太爷留下的明珠，老爷。不管您拿去做什么，老奴什么也没看见。”\", \"7915c6afce6f\"]]"},{"name":"given","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“The chest is locked again, master. No one will know.”\", \"“箱子又锁好了，老爷。没人会知道。”\", \"6ec791821427\"]]"}]},{"id":32,"name":"in-2","type":"npc","x":184.0,"y":78.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.official"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_official"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“This is the county office. State your business.”\", \"“这里是县衙，有何贵干？”\", \"5e0392a83d17\"]]"}]},{"id":33,"name":"exit-changan","type":"exit","x":160,"y":144,"width":16,"height":16,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"changan"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"S"}]},{"id":34,"name":"entry-changan","type":"entry","x":168.0,"y":142.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"changan"}]},{"id":35,"name":"entry","type":"entry","x":168.0,"y":142.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true}]}]}